      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With compressor + binary parameter budgeting + encoded wardrobe modes, you can run full FT (eye/mouth/cheek/brow/tongue), OSC extras, and even BCI appendage control today without slamming into the memory wall at the cost of slamming my own skull against a wall\n\nBut none of this removes the need for a 512-bit upgrade on PC, we’re overdue",
