      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree. I've recently added toe tracking, and that too currently has to eat an additional 52 bits of expression data, right next to face tracking, and etc. And many compromises had to be made on the tracking accuracy as we do not have access to provide real quaternion rotation.\n\nIn order to have an avatar with maximum visual expression, big compromises have to be made, even with MemoryOptimizer or other compression tools compressing down clothing/accessories toggles.\n\nAnd things that require realtime updating cannot be compressed down without compromising tracking quality.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
